Kokoro-82M
    Author:   hexgrad
    License:  Apache License 2.0
    Source:   https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M

    The neural text-to-speech model that produces this app's announce voice.
    Built on StyleTTS 2 (Li et al., MIT License, https://github.com/yl4579/StyleTTS2).

    The model weights are NOT redistributed in this repository — they are 234 MB
    and gitignored, fetched and converted by ios/get-kokoro-coreml.sh. What IS
    redistributed is ios/Runner/KokoroAssets/KokoroClips/: 427 audio clips that
    are OUTPUT of the model, rendered by scripts/kokocli.swift.

