kokoro-swift
    Author:   Max Weinbach (github.com/mweinbach)
    License:  Apache License 2.0
    Source:   https://github.com/mweinbach/kokoro-swift

    Swift inference for Kokoro-82M. Only the Core ML half is vendored here, in
    ios/Runner/Kokoro/ — the MLX/Metal backend is deliberately left behind (see
    ios/Runner/Kokoro/VENDOR.md for why, and for every change made).

    Files derived from this work, and MODIFIED by Halfmarble LLC:
        ios/Runner/Kokoro/SegmentedCoreMLModel.swift
        ios/Runner/Kokoro/KokoroConfig.swift
        ios/Runner/Kokoro/Misaki/Lexicon.swift

    Files derived from this work and included unchanged:
        ios/Runner/Kokoro/Misaki/EnglishG2P.swift
        ios/Runner/Kokoro/Misaki/MToken.swift
        ios/Runner/Kokoro/Misaki/NumberToWords.swift

    Files written by Halfmarble LLC to replace upstream types that could not be
    used without linking MLX (KPipeline, VoiceLoader, CoreMLVoiceAdapter), and
    which follow upstream's dataflow:
        ios/Runner/Kokoro/KokoroTTS.swift
        ios/Runner/Kokoro/KokoroVoices.swift

